Speaker 0: Seems like one story that got republished on every single website that, you know, is an AI generated website that republishes news.

256
00:19:19,650 --> 00:19:20,131
Speaker 1: Yeah.

257
00:19:21,554 --> 00:19:30,330
Speaker 1: There's a weird Reddit thread about it too, but I read all these articles and I can't find anything that appears that this company did anything wrong.

