01:02:53,130 --> 01:02:57,489
Speaker 1: I didn't even get to talk about the book ritual, or Hernah, or Tug of Peace, which I loved.

850
01:02:57,610 --> 01:02:58,557
Speaker 0: I didn't get to talk about Dr.

851
01:02:58,617 --> 01:03:00,430
Speaker 1: Garf, who I fucked.

