Speaker 1: Or South Scrimshaw text adventure with a giant whale.

853
01:03:04,851 --> 01:03:06,135
Speaker 0: Yeah.

854
01:03:06,657 --> 01:03:10,250
Speaker 0: But yeah, there was just so much going on in that room.

