Speaker 0: That room was at previous MAGFest, but it was twice or at least twice as stacked as it was previously.

856
01:03:18,091 --> 01:03:20,370
Speaker 0: I could have spent way more hours in just that one room.

857
01:03:20,931 --> 01:03:26,585
Speaker 1: It was notable how expanded and amazing that room was.

858
01:03:26,645 --> 01:03:27,848
Speaker 1: I cannot praise it enough.

859
01:03:27,928 --> 01:03:28,810
Speaker 1: Good job, MAGFest.

860
01:03:29,410 --> 01:03:33,810
Speaker 1: I think Mibs is going to grow and be a very, very critical part of that con forever.

861
01:03:34,050 --> 01:03:41,490
Speaker 0: The way I see it is, if you look at anime cons, they got their dealer's room, and then they got their artist alley, which is really just cheap dealer's room.

862
01:03:41,890 --> 01:03:43,630
Speaker 1: This is more like installation alley.

863
01:03:44,591 --> 01:03:46,436
Speaker 0: Right, but that's only half of it.

