Speaker 0: The other half of it is just booths.

865
01:03:47,860 --> 01:03:49,705
Speaker 0: Normal old booths, not installations.

866
01:03:49,745 --> 01:03:51,310
Speaker 0: Only the arcade part is installations.

867
01:03:53,010 --> 01:03:57,759
Speaker 0: But it's like if there was a second PAX expo hall.

